Mom?

37
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:13,050
Dad?

38
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:15,553
Your blood is not
your own, Cal.

39
00:07:18,806 --> 00:07:20,516
They've found us.

40
00:07:37,491 --> 00:07:39,201
