48
00:09:48,956 --> 00:09:50,624
Yeah.

49
00:09:50,916 --> 00:09:52,626
The party is just
getting started.

50
00:09:57,089 --> 00:09:59,758
Sit down.
You're making me nervous.

51
00:10:15,858 --> 00:10:17,568
Lord,

52
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:19,570
wash away my sin,

53
00:10:20,487 --> 00:10:22,198
