to the perfection of human kind.

82
00:16:09,628 --> 00:16:13,674
With your help, we can pioneer
new ways to eradicate violence.

83
00:16:34,987 --> 00:16:36,655
I had this.

84
00:16:36,906 --> 00:16:38,365
