85
00:16:38,449 --> 00:16:39,408
He's my patient.

86
00:16:39,909 --> 00:16:41,619
This is my program.

87
00:16:44,038 --> 00:16:45,748
Prepare the Animus.

88
00:16:57,009 --> 00:16:58,427
Are the blades prepared?

89
00:16:58,469 --> 00:16:59,178
Right here.

90
00:17:00,429 --> 00:17:02,056
And we confirmed
