137
00:27:05,743 --> 00:27:08,495
Run a system's check,
and log his condition.

138
00:27:10,331 --> 00:27:11,999
You did well, Cal.

139
00:27:31,101 --> 00:27:33,395
Looking back it's
clear that a history

140
00:27:33,479 --> 00:27:35,731
of the world is
history a violence.

141
