your MAO-A gene.

227
00:35:01,088 --> 00:35:02,798
I know about the foster homes.

228
00:35:02,840 --> 00:35:04,550
The juvenile homes.

229
00:35:06,010 --> 00:35:09,179
You are a living proof of the
link between heredity and crime.

230
00:35:09,221 --> 00:35:10,931
